OL,3,GNEWSA'Lucky' mum praises baby study
OL,4,Aafter gene find
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Bradford mum has said she feels
OL,7,F"ridiculously lucky" after a chance
OL,8,Fparticipation in a medical study found
OL,9,Fher two sons had a genetic change
OL,10,Flinked to a rare condition.
OL,12,FJessica Barker-Roe said she had agreed
OL,13,Ffor her youngest son to take part in
OL,14,Fthe Generation Study - run by Genomics
OL,15,FEngland and the NHS - when she was
OL,16,F"bored" during a stay in hospital.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,382,380,200,160,0,100
