OL,3,GNEWSA'Lucky' mum praises baby study
OL,4,Aafter gene find
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt found her boys Revan and Thorin had
OL,7,Fadrenoleukodystrophy, also known as
OL,8,FALD, which affects the adrenal glands
OL,9,Fand nerves of the spinal cord - but
OL,10,Fcareful monitoring should mean they
OL,11,Favoid life-limiting complications.
OL,13,FThe Generation Study is screening
OL,14,F100,000 newborn babies in England for
OL,15,Fdozens of genetic conditions.
